      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AXEL'S RUN (1) has a terrific record this trip with five wins and one placing from six starts. Recorded a 1.3 lengths win (25.10) in a Grade 5 last time at Grafton. Has the ability and should feature. ZAZU'S JOURNEY (4) finished fifth last time (26.01) at this track after winning at his previous two outings. Strike rate this distance strong having won three of six tries. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Should be in this for a long way. BIONIC BILL (8) failed to come into contention last start at this track, but prior to that won by 0.8 lengths at Q Parklands (29.95) beating Bagless Brute in a Grade 5 on October 11. One of the better hopes. AUSSIE ZIP (2) is another with top-three prospects.",
